{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0982dc45aea1b362d499b8c86e33a82298727d8c09ed8f61be0f7d95ff18e3d",
      "text": "……啊，话说回来。\n前些天聊到了写给父母的信对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034c1580e2c5dbb195c7dd308f80716b3df78eb4506d12e7c1243779dcc67cb6",
      "text": "当时稍微有点惊讶呢。\n没想到所有人都写过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41665e09533d6904c225c239c004cc69343787c0be074212637f7dac36cf8e61",
      "text": "东云写的信，我大概能猜得到哦。\n毕竟我们认识那么久了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d78f8d3900abb0c3a320f83bfa2653a837dbc1a582527e6cb398e608a461384e",
      "text": "这句话原封不动奉还给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bd51961fe761d7b79807bd0f5272d19f506d3ee220e4644c6886d2ac8ed792e",
      "text": "哈哈。直到那时之前我都忘了信的存在，\n内容却记得很清楚呢。真奇妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d58ec17a826963f3747e426380b2a4a752b59720c166bb571227dffee747e2f9",
      "text": "……我的父母，是热衷于教育且很严厉的人对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fcc18632e54b69c8afe803366f7fa292c4e43d71159034f722edb275080f7eb",
      "text": "过去我应该也跟你发过不少牢骚，说跟向往\n自由生活的自己合不来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba7acbcdb785d3c230b5fc018b343dfb940aa8a44f0c95c0e04e0010194ce0c5",
      "text": "信里也是这么写的。\n“我想活得更自由！”这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239d64acf4519d01e9c52657b811d31672059da0cc520851c0aef272760be550",
      "text": "但是，结果到最后也没能送出去。\n因为高中一毕业我就跑出家门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0ed63cc2171788ef499b98aaf47e50a3b240bd38287dca7fb563598250cebf",
      "text": "“想活得更自由”“希望你们能更多地理解我”……\n我记得尽是写了些这样的话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7963965de1eb5893859f8a74396eaa7707a1cc6547af94b79b804dcd49295e6",
      "text": "当时的我，真的很任性又孩子气啊。\n……不，现在其实也没什么改变吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bddf9f8d75dd07726357837206eea4bb8774212321e64d91bfe74b81637f941",
      "text": "跑出家门之后，一次也没回过家……\n开起了咖啡厅，当起了偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19adbcfcab557283af47d1583703ac27d84337aa2c6d9f30938cdde54b0ee385",
      "text": "尽由着自己的性子来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d4eacc3f9fcbd0ebf3c6ea149b9dd1f168fc40588243a4236d4e5c09fb12f5",
      "text": "……我其实也是半斤八两。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40ed35b47a136994ab27241ee499a08876aa383e205997c200b0cbc3631f8b09",
      "text": "从家里祖传的和果子店逃了出来，\n在这里一味地研究西点。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
